cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this project in academic work, please cite it."
type: software
title: "MSX1 on Tang Nano 20K"
abstract: >
  An MSX1 computer in Verilog for the Tang Nano 20K FPGA board
  (Gowin GW2AR-18C): Z80 (tv80 core), TMS9918A VDP with HDMI output,
  AY-3-8910 PSG, Intel 8255 PPI, 64 KB RAM in the embedded SDRAM,
  PS/2 keyboard and an SPI port for the microSD slot.
license: MIT
keywords:
  - fpga
  - msx
  - z80
  - verilog
  - retro-computing
  - tang-nano
  - gowin
  - hdmi
  - tms9918a
  - ay8910
repository-code: "https://github.com/charlesmmorais/msx1-tang-nano-20k"
